<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Cricket-Australia v West Indies scoreboard.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Cricket-Australia v West Indies scoreboard.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the fourth day of the second test between Australia and West Indies at the Sydney Cricket Ground on Monday.</p>
<p>Australia first innings 331</p>
<p>West Indies first innings 304</p>
<p>Australia second innings (overnight 77 for two)</p>
<p> M.Taylor c Lara b Bishop		     16</p>
<p> M.Elliott retired hurt			 78</p>
<p> R.Ponting c Browne b Bishop		   4</p>
<p> M.Waugh c Browne b Ambrose		   67</p>
<p> M.Bevan c Browne b Benjamin		  52</p>
<p> G.Blewett not out				47</p>
<p> I.Healy not out				  22</p>
<p> Extras (nb-9 b-4 lb-10 w-3)		  26</p>
<p> Total (for four declared, 106 overs)    312</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-51, 2-67, 3-209, 4-274.</p>
<p>Did not bat: S.Warne, M.Kasprowicz, J.Gillespie, G.McGrath.</p>
<p>Bowling: Ambrose 20-2-66-1 (nb-3), Walsh 19-6-36-0 (nb-4), Bishop 20-5-54-2 (nb-1 w-3), Benjamin 16-4-46-1 (nb-1), Adams 4-0-21-0, Hooper 27-7-75-0.  </p>
<p>West Indies second innings</p>
<p> S.Campbell not out		     13</p>
<p> R.Samuels not out			12</p>
<p> Extras (lb-1 nb-1)			2</p>
<p> Total (for no wicket, 12 overs)    27</p>
<p>To bat: B.Lara, C.Hooper, S.Chanderpaul, J.Adams, C.Browne, I.Bishop, C.Ambrose, K.Benjamin, C.Walsh</p>
<p>Bowling: McGrath 4-1-7-0 (nb-1), Waugh 4-0-15-0, Gillespie 2-0-3-0, Warne 2-1-1-0.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
